## Overall Assessment

The NIST NCSTAR 1-9A report provides **significant WTC 7 structural documentation** (148 WTC 7 mentions, 528 column mentions, 117 core mentions) but does NOT contain floor plans, site plans, or plaza documentation. The full NCSTAR 1-1 through 1-9 collection (84 items) is still needed to address the critical gaps for floor plans and site plans.

**WTC 7 readiness has improved significantly.** All other areas remain unchanged.